SUMMARY:Tarot Masterclass at West Art
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow travellers on the path to deeper understanding of this amazing journey through life!\nA weekly course using the ancient cards.\nWeek 1: Overview The History and Mystery of Tarot\n*What is Divination?\n*Basic Structure of the Deck–why 78 cards?\n*The Five Elements\n*Choosing\, Caring for\, and Using Your Deck\n*The Daily Tarot Reading\nThe last fifteen minutes of each class will be focused of practice readings for\nyourself or classmates. Handouts and additional resources provided; Homework assigned!\n\nWeek 2: The Major Arcana–Pathways of the Soul\n*What are the “Trumps”?\n*Definitions & Keywords\n*The Tree of Life\n*Symbolism in the Tarot\n*Carl Jung\, Archetypes and the Collective Unconscious\n*Creative Journaling with the Major Arcana\n\nWeek 3: The Minor Arcana\n*The Four Suits and Four Elements–what do they represent?\n*Number Symbolism\n*What are the Decans?\n*Astrology & the Tarot\n*Connecting the Minors to everyday events\n*Definitions and keywords\nHomework: Personality Type Questionnaire to be completed before next session\n\nWeek 4: The Court Cards–16 Personalities\n*Why 16 “Face” cards instead of 12?\n*Your Personality Type and Your Significator\n*Combining the 4 Elements\n*Finding your Birth Card\n*Telling a Tarot Story\n*Definitions and Keywords\n*Tarot and Decision Making\n*Tarot Shorthand\n*Advanced Readings and Resources \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/tarot-masterclass/2026-05-02/
LOCATION:West Art\, 800 Buchanan Ave\, Lancaster PA\, Lancaster\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Education & Classes
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/Tarot-Masterclass-Postcard-for-Insta-etc.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="West Art":MAILTO:westartlanc@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
