SUMMARY:Music Friday and Keys For The City Kickoff Celebration!
DESCRIPTION:Music For Everyone is excited to announce that Music Fridays and Keys For The City are back! Join us at Binns Park from 5:30 to 8:00  PM for a vibrant evening filled with live music\, community\, and celebration. Enjoy performances from the MFE Community Chorus\, Ukulele Uprising\, The Sound Factory\, and more as they take the stage\, and hear from founder John Gerdy. Come be a part of this special moment as we celebrate the 17th year of Keys For The City and celebrate Lancaster for being the Street Piano Capital of the World!\n\nCome experience the joy of music\, connect with your community\, and kick off the season in style! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/music-friday-and-keys-for-the-city-kickoff-celebration/
LOCATION:Binns Park\, 120 North Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment,Community
ORGANIZER;CN="Music For Everyone":MAILTO:info@musicforeveryone.org
END:VEVENT
