SUMMARY:Fresh Takes On Jazz: Aaron Rudderow & North of Now !
DESCRIPTION:“Fresh Takes on Jazz” is a unique concert series presented by Music For Everyone and Mickey’s Black Box. Join us on May 17th for Aaron Rudderow and North of Now! Aaron is a drummer and composer whose tunes blend jazz\, rock\, funk and fusion. Aaron\, 22\, of Ephrata\, is a Lebanon Valley College graduate. He and his band will release their first album later this year. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
